# Styling & i18n

## Styling
- Use NativeWind `className` with semantic colors (`bg-background`, `text-foreground`, `bg-accent`, …).
- Theme tokens live in `src/shared/theme/tokens.ts` and map to CSS vars in `vars.ts`.
- Compose classes with `cn()` from `@/shared/lib/cn`.
- Prefer CVA variants for reusable interactive components (see `Button`).

## i18n
- All user-facing strings go through `useTranslation()` / `t('…')`.
- Add keys to both `locales/en.ts` and `locales/ar.ts` (AR must satisfy `Translations`).
- RTL is handled by `I18nProvider` + `applyLanguageDirection` — use logical spacing (`ms`/`me`/`ps`/`pe`) when possible.
- Never hardcode English-only UI copy in screens.
